.TH SHB-POLICY 1 "October 2026" "SecretHarbor 0.4.0-prod" "SecretHarbor Manual"
.SH NAME
shb-policy \- Policy validation and resource decision explanation
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBshb policy <check|explain> [resource]\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
Validate policy or debug security decisions for specific files, environment variables, or network domains.
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
\fBcheck\fR
Validates the active policy file and reports its effective settings.
.TP
\fBexplain\fR
Answers 'Why was this operation denied, faked, or allowed?' Details matched rule, effective agent access vs human access, and rule origin.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
$ \fBshb policy check\fR
.TP
$ \fBshb policy explain .env\fR
.TP
$ \fBshb policy explain DATABASE_URL\fR
.TP
$ \fBshb policy explain --network api.stripe.com\fR
.SH SEE ALSO
shb(1)
.SH WEBSITE
https://secretharbor.dev
